title: "Retrieving Climate Change Adaptation Concepts from World Heritage Management Plans in the Netherlands"
abstract: >-
  Code, extracted chunks, concept definitions, alignment output and
  LLM-as-judge prompts and judgements accompanying the ClimateNLP workshop
  paper on retrieving climate change adaptation concepts from Dutch World
  Heritage management plans.
